m3utolocal searches M3U playlists by tvg-id or tvg-name and downloads
static VOD media (mp4, mkv, etc.), skipping live streams. Features include
resume via .part files, multi-threaded downloads, retries, an interactive
selection UI, cleanup of stale partials, and downloads stored under an
XDG data library (or -o) instead of the current working directory.

WWW: https://github.com/marklapointe/m3utolocal
